    "note": "Reengrossed version (04/20/2024), not the final act. Amendments made after the version read (Senate) are not in the text read. Section 3 (C.R.S. 10-4-122) requires insurers to offer the coverage, which supports the same rule. In 18-12-116(1)(a) the text file puts the words AS A RESULT OF ANY ACCIDENTAL OR UNINTENTIONAL out of line order (a layout quirk); the quote gives the sentence in reading order."
